I'll see you next time.

00:20:36.750 --> 00:20:55.380
Freedom means being able to go where you want to go, to dress like you want to dress, to be with whomever you want to be with, to live where you want to live without anybody stopping you or telling you what you are allowed to do.

00:20:55.480 --> 00:20:56.640
Freedom is your birthright.

00:20:57.140 --> 00:20:59.560
It's not anything that anybody can take away from you.

00:21:00.000 --> 00:21:08.200
born with it. They can, people can put you in here or try to stop you from going there, but as long as

